{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:702","content":{"id":702,"title":"盛水最多的容器","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"6b178bfe-cc07-4579-b315-6a05c3c1947a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"02477010-ac30-4584-91c9-c790e8c9a05a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"ba6871c9-25bc-4a88-93a3-c012fef2a274","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}],"tex":"n"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个非负整数 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"970603a2-e55f-438c-a441-b30d1bf269ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a_1, a_2, \\cdots, a_n"}],"tex":"a_1, a_2, \\cdots, a_n"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，每个数代表坐标中的一个点 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"c029ba2e-0d16-451d-b340-91b1360c9ba9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, a_i)"}],"tex":"(i, a_i)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。在坐标内画出 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"14b1dce1-a533-4f8c-a246-2748169db8bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}],"tex":"n"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 条垂直线，垂直线 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"c8d386b2-1535-4c93-9f2d-d2e8f6dcd126","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"i"}],"tex":"i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的两个端点 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"20c61ec7-d651-4461-80d2-153d95ac7aab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, a_i)"}],"tex":"(i, a_i)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"7986524e-4ded-4264-a8b0-af798e42d535","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, 0)"}],"tex":"(i, 0)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。找出其中的两条线，使得它们与 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"ac228f92-26b5-42bd-9473-a6fdb5613994","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x"}],"tex":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 轴共同构成容器可以容纳最多的水。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","collabId":"d90b272e-db2d-47ec-a326-7b6af3a100e3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2b24d0e5-1dff-4196-9f99-5ac98e907bba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说明：不能倾斜容器。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"328ea8e2-22ac-46dc-8dc9-dd1376fc8b9f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例如，给定如下非负整数 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"af3aa875-09ae-4e86-b997-146e0475aaa7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[1, 8, 6, 2, 5, 4, 8, 3, 7]"}],"tex":"[1, 8, 6, 2, 5, 4, 8, 3, 7]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4c3941ee-9c6c-4106-8706-fe9189aff07d.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4c3941ee-9c6c-4106-8706-fe9189aff07d.png","width":209.99999165535007,"collabId":"3a1e379d-619b-4dc1-91cf-c214dfc016f4","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d44454a3-ac1e-4492-9543-1bdbeeb76f7a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如图两条红色线形成的蓝色区域能够盛放最多的水，其值为 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"36747cb4-4cd7-4d1e-a9de-e3a5c9582f35","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"7*7=49"}],"tex":"7 \\times 7=49"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"4a9f49f5-d49a-4d07-863d-93baf1bb5932","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a396dec8-9dbb-4551-8e63-031012ae4e37","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最简单的思路就是遍历所有柱之间能够容纳多少流量，然后取最大值"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"25401e00-0c8f-4f05-ac4d-b7d9b4f4329d","collabId":"d1896d0b-9b9c-4432-9a6a-f9aff28a9492","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"public int maxArea(int[] height) {\n    int max = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < height.length - 1; i++) {\n        for (int j = i + 1; j < height.length; j++) {\n            max = Math.max(max, (j - i) * Math.min(height[i], height[j]));\n        }\n    }\n    \n    return max;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cd4d8983-97fd-4f54-87f7-80710848aa96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们考虑一个更快的算法。我们考虑范围 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"0aa2bd8d-3639-404f-9515-74dfd8f28083","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[i, j]"}],"tex":"[i, j]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之间的柱子能够容纳多少水量。首先考虑边界的两个柱子 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"dc34597f-4b19-4c47-81d4-d88f88c0a3c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, a_i)"}],"tex":"(i, a_i)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"cba3fe30-e245-4f1d-8cbd-d9c30295a4ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(j, a_j)"}],"tex":"(j, a_j)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之间能够容纳多少水量，我们不妨假设 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"4a96d5df-e4da-48d6-b27a-ab9369718b1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a_i \\leq a_j"}],"tex":"a_i \\leq a_j"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么它们之间能够容纳的水为"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"f0fbffb3-f317-49da-9ebe-a0c703798a41","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"a_i * (j - i)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a0f68e89-b306-4b07-bc56-424dac73be79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么对于任何 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"b3abf59f-5ede-48c6-ac0c-f5649a9c6e30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"i < k < j"}],"tex":"i < k < j"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们可以确定柱 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"058be521-04ec-499e-b4bc-970139ef6ceb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, a_i)"}],"tex":"(i, a_i)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与柱 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"8760b768-8160-43a7-b513-b743ae56a147","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(k, a_k)"}],"tex":"(k, a_k)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能够容纳的水量一定小于 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"4efc236e-32eb-4373-befc-e99855b74677","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a_i * (j - i)"}],"tex":"a_i * (j - i)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。因为"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","collabId":"a335090f-e6ff-49eb-b53b-73857d8ff7af","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"09a0e1ee-f290-4629-8f78-bdc7bdda8594","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"262aed95-835d-4939-8ac4-6e4e611ab95d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"586ce063-8438-4c63-bb7b-ee374724aa3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x"}],"tex":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"b7354c88-f2f4-4be4-bd25-849ee385a88e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a_k"}],"tex":"a_k"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之间最短的边为 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"b10e5230-2ee9-4b54-a840-2a46ee3c8e46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\min ( a_i, a_k ) \\leq a_i"}],"tex":"\\min ( a_i, a_k ) \\leq a_i"},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"d1ea4c01-504e-44a9-a11f-3fbcd0294ab1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d0c1b0ea-d2da-4d8b-ab3e-3e7bffef30fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为"},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"9f6a3c64-b934-4b3e-8e4f-cced70b6107f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"i < k < j"}],"tex":"i < k < j"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"cb79a2d3-3a01-4649-99ee-49208c5ee233","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"k - i < j - i"}],"tex":"k - i < j - i"},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"140f4606-9a76-4094-bce7-b5849898eab1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"d9bff5c7-bf06-44d8-a2cf-e86125672e36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, x)"}],"tex":"(i, x)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与"},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"91045a08-07ab-41a2-af1e-64ed01a430a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(k ,a_k)"}],"tex":"(k ,a_k)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能够包含的水量"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"09357876-46e1-468b-92ff-2f245209f418","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\min ( a_i, a_k ) * (k - i) < a_i * (j - i)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1d8a8368-b3a3-4acc-9833-dcd22c0c6407","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为找的是能够容纳"},{"type":"formatted","color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)","text":"最大的水量"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们不必考虑 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"4794fd56-8928-47c3-9961-a7cd4c2a14ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, a_i)"}],"tex":"(i, a_i)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与其他柱的配对了，这样可以减少很多的计算量。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"bb049706-76a8-4c07-b589-06d05462c1e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将上面的想法转化为算法步骤，我们的目的是计算范围 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"13fdaf94-4410-4a18-89a2-8a6d55ab12ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[0, length-1]"}],"tex":"[0, \\text{length}-1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之间的柱子能够容纳多少水量，初始令 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i = 0, j = length -1"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。算法过程为，当我们来到"},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"d31c1a45-a6bb-45e2-8f8d-7b08a2435cc3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, a_i)"}],"tex":"(i, a_i)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"0f7cedcf-1fbf-4d57-9413-6869eb6fcfe5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(j, a_j)"}],"tex":"(j, a_j)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 两个柱时："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","collabId":"fdd54496-0eb0-44d0-bdf8-12faa6c780ee","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"46f83638-028d-4084-90ef-d94a458e65b1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"44a926e1-2dc7-45a2-b781-916d59741643","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先计算它们能够容纳多少水量，如果大于目前的最大值，则更新最大值，否则不更新最大值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"7701e283-9b27-4677-a85e-77a4b7648eb3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"538b2834-fae0-4e91-a826-0b132a24762a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"925d8eec-b7e7-4eec-aad7-16a93366871e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a_i \\leq a_j"}],"tex":"a_i \\leq a_j"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么不必计算柱 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"3b68a4c3-484b-4cb5-9fd4-aae4d8b4d12c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(i, a_i)"}],"tex":"(i, a_i)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与其他柱的配对，执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i++"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"1a18ff23-dc9a-4aad-aa0c-91f0e0c51881","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"af7e42f3-1a6f-4b1f-aa15-2739c461853f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"44864d02-1d6c-4366-8c83-18c598a33ae3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a_i > a_j"}],"tex":"a_i > a_j"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么不必计算 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"9f91576a-9df2-4bb3-8855-3011c583ef77","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(j, a_j)"}],"tex":"(j, a_j)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与其他柱的配对，执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"j--"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7e8ae96a-3a7f-4b11-af1f-9d53e8dad057","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"e4113a97-a037-4e1e-81a1-c3b8b2aec92f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"i \\geq j"}],"tex":"i \\geq j"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，算法执行结束，此时的最大值即为能够容纳的最大水量。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"94eb80ac-ae21-4259-875e-2399bfaf02a3","collabId":"96211812-f892-4ca4-b88f-2dcc8dfa1f05","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"public int maxArea(int[] height) {\n\n    int start = 0;\n    int end = height.length - 1;\n\n    int max= 0;\n    \n    while (start < end) {\n        // 计算两个柱之间能够容纳的水量，如果大于最大值，则更新最大值\n        int s = (end - start) * Math.min(height[start], height[end]);\n        if (max < s) {\n            max = s;\n        }\n        // 如果 a_i <= a_j，则 i++，否则 j--\n        if (height[start] <= height[end]) {\n            start++;\n        } else {\n            end--;\n        }\n    }\n    return max;\n}"},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"842fa764-c643-4df1-bd71-4b8fc17f86b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"0f0aadb1-2278-4476-bd74-ae987eefc772","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c7952d67-1be8-40ba-8774-4dface083c78","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"eb68a47a-337e-4e8e-a6f2-2dc0424fc800","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/container-with-most-water/submissions/","openEdit":false,"collabId":"9579c12e-64ea-4fc2-855c-88a36ad7ca98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"盛水最多的容器"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"双指针"},{"label":"盛水最多的容器","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:702","type":"doc","id":702}}],"prevPage":{"title":"删除有序数组中的重复项","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:701","type":"doc","id":701}},"nextPage":{"title":"搜索旋转排序数组II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:703","type":"doc","id":703}},"createTime":1729001437382,"updateTime":1791553078152,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1791553078152}}